    "kiana:015": "Old Continue retired in place; letter, pardon and refusal enacted.",
    "kiana:016": "Happy rescue and unresolved-pouch siblings read release, not called.",
    "kiana:017": "Personal grievance needs soul_lost; dog-only grievance is distinct.",
